Integration notes
=================
Company registry, tax, credit bureau and compliance integrations are simulated
locally by backend/app/integrations. Demonstration data is synthetic.
No external AI service is required by the current frontend implementation.

Scope: this is the initial frontend inventory. Backend/ML component, model and
dataset notices must be completed by their owners before hackathon submission.
